{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-explainer-about-popular-pets-teach-dogs-cats-goldfish-and-birds-as-common-pets-teach-he/audio/main-b55dd6397fcf.mp3","durationSec":146.664,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.26,"text":"A pet is an animal that people keep for company or fun."},{"start":3.26,"end":6.26,"text":"Dogs and cats are very popular pets."},{"start":7.06,"end":8.88,"text":"Fish and birds are common pets too."},{"start":9.66,"end":13.5,"text":"People may want a pet for friendship, beauty, or help protecting a home."},{"start":14.26,"end":19,"text":"When we compare pets, we can ask three simple questions: Does it fit the home?"},{"start":19.66,"end":21.04,"text":"How much time does it need?"},{"start":21.76,"end":23.2,"text":"Why does the person want it?"},{"start":24.34,"end":26.48,"text":"Dogs often live closely with people."},{"start":26.48,"end":29.88,"text":"Many people enjoy playing with them and taking them for walks."},{"start":29.88,"end":34.24,"text":"Cats also give people company, but they can be quieter at home."},{"start":34.24,"end":39.56,"text":"Cats can live indoors and usually need less outdoor walking than many dogs."},{"start":40.4,"end":48.1,"text":"For example, a busy person in an apartment may prefer a cat, while an active family may enjoy walking with a dog."},{"start":49.1,"end":55.76,"text":"A goldfish is a freshwater fish often kept in an indoor aquarium, a glass home for fish."},{"start":55.76,"end":60.48,"text":"Goldfish were first bred for color in China and later spread to other countries."},{"start":61.34,"end":63.42,"text":"Birds can also be colorful companions."},{"start":64.58,"end":67.22,"text":"Budgies and cockatiels are popular pet birds."},{"start":68.1,"end":71.5,"text":"People may choose birds for their company, color, or song."},{"start":72.5,"end":75.64,"text":"Both fish and birds can bring beauty into a home."},{"start":76.8,"end":78.66,"text":"Some people keep hermit crabs as pets."},{"start":79.66,"end":86.62,"text":"A hermit crab can be a fun or unusual choice because it is very different from a dog, cat, fish, or bird."},{"start":87.38,"end":89.76,"text":"Here, unusual does not mean bad."},{"start":90.48,"end":94.16,"text":"It means that fewer people first think of this animal when they hear the word “pet.”"},{"start":95.1,"end":99,"text":"A person may choose one because they enjoy small and interesting animals."},{"start":99.82,"end":106.34,"text":"People in different countries may choose different pets because their homes, daily routines, and reasons are different."},{"start":107.56,"end":112.98,"text":"Imagine one person in a small apartment and another person in a house with more outdoor space."},{"start":113.34,"end":115.76,"text":"The first person may choose a goldfish or cat."},{"start":116.28,"end":118.52,"text":"The second may choose a dog for walks and play."},{"start":119.18,"end":124.12,"text":"Some people want friendship, while others enjoy an animal’s beauty or want help protecting a home."},{"start":124.7,"end":127.74,"text":"A popular pet is not always the right pet for every person."},{"start":128.44,"end":131.82,"text":"It is important to think again about home, time, and reason."},{"start":132.7,"end":135.1,"text":"A dog may suit someone who enjoys daily walks."},{"start":135.7,"end":137.58,"text":"A cat may suit a quieter indoor home."},{"start":138.06,"end":142.58,"text":"A goldfish needs an aquarium, and a bird may interest someone who likes color and song."},{"start":143.44,"end":146.2,"text":"Someone who wants a less common animal may think about a hermit crab."}],"words":[{"text":"A","start":0,"end":0.2},{"text":"pet","start":0.2,"end":0.42},{"text":"is","start":0.42,"end":0.58},{"text":"an","start":0.58,"end":0.76},{"text":"animal","start":0.76,"end":1.08},{"text":"that","start":1.08,"end":1.3},{"text":"people","start":1.3,"end":1.56},{"text":"keep","start":1.56,"end":1.84},{"text":"for","start":1.84,"end":2.08}